vw:Campaign_Q5_Winter a vw:IncentiveCampaign ; rdfs:label "Q5 winter offer" ; vw:campaignAppliesTo vw:Q5 .
vw:Campaign_Octavia_Fleet a vw:IncentiveCampaign ; rdfs:label "Octavia fleet offer" ; vw:campaignAppliesTo vw:Octavia .

